## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate knowledge of biblical counseling principles.
- Integrate Christian theology with counseling approaches.
- Understand human behavior and spiritual development.
- Apply biblical principles to pastoral care and counseling.
- Recognize the role of prayer and the Holy Spirit in spiritual care.
- Demonstrate ethical practices and appropriate counseling boundaries.
- Provide compassionate Christian guidance and spiritual support.
